This project is a fork of dsh-live-terminal
(https://github.com/Lancang-hzau/dsh-live-terminal, MIT), re-skinned for the
Claude Code Desktop visual language and re-targeted at the DSH **web** profile.

Upstream parts retained under their original MIT license:
  - host half: lib/index.js, lib/host/*.js      (dsh-live-terminal)
  - client logic: client-src/*.ts, *.tsx        (dsh-live-terminal)
  - xterm.js and addons, MIT (https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js)

Original additions in this repository:
  - Claude skin layer appended to client-src/styles.ts
  - Claude ANSI palette + accent cursor in client-src/theme.ts
  - web-profile install/uninstall scripts and packaging metadata

The MIT license text in LICENSE applies to the whole repository.
